1140..1214 Comment "/// The state-passing model answers the scope in place of written clauses:"
1215..1288 Comment "/// each operation is the model\'s, so the subject computes a value of its"
1289..1364 Comment "/// carrier, a function of the initial state. Storing four and then reading"
1365..1441 Comment "/// twice, both reads see four, as `putThenGet` calls the model\'s operations"
1442..1454 Comment "/// by hand."
